<p class="eyebrow">Configuration</p>
<h1>Finish the Azure AD B2C setup</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Copy <code>.env.example</code> to <code>.env</code> and fill in the values from
  your B2C tenant, then restart the app.
</p>

<ol class="steps">
  <li>Create a sign-up/sign-in <strong>user flow</strong> (e.g. <code>B2C_1_signupsignin</code>).</li>
  <li>Register a <strong>Web</strong> app and add the redirect URI <code>http://localhost:3000/auth/callback</code>.</li>
  <li>Enable <strong>ID tokens</strong> for the implicit grant is <em>not</em> needed — this app uses the authorization code flow.</li>
  <li>Create a <strong>client secret</strong> and set <code>B2C_CLIENT_ID</code> / <code>B2C_CLIENT_SECRET</code>.</li>
  <li>Add <code>http://localhost:3000/</code> as a <strong>front-channel logout / post logout redirect URI</strong>.</li>
</ol>

